-- Daily-pool depth. Roadmap item 1 (docs/ROADMAP.md): the daily pool was
-- 6–13 questions per relationship type plus 13 shared, so a pair started
-- seeing repeats after about three weeks. Competitors ship hundreds. This
-- adds 414 single-question daily templates (55 shared, 56 romantic, 54 friend, 53 family, 50 coworker, 50 parent_child, 48 sibling, 48 mentor), framework-tagged like
-- the existing seeds, with the same format mix (free text, 1–10 scale,
-- single choice). No schema change; ensure_daily_prompt already prefers
-- unused templates, so existing pairs simply stop repeating.
--
-- Idempotent: every row carries config.batch = '0020' and the insert is
-- skipped if that batch is already present, so re-running is harmless.

do $$
begin
  if exists (select 1 from prompt_templates where config->>'batch' = '0020') then
    raise notice 'batch 0020 already seeded; skipping';
    return;
  end if;

end $$;
